---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SectionHeader from '../components/SectionHeader.astro';
import { LINKS } from '../config';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | Dragon Bot 2.0"
  description="The terms for using Dragon Bot 2.0."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 pb-8 pt-16 md:pt-20">
    <SectionHeader as="h1" title="Terms of Service" lead="Last updated: October 2026" />
  </section>

  <section class="prose-site mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 pb-24">
    <p>
      By adding or using Dragon Bot 2.0 ("the bot"), you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, do not use the bot.
    </p>

    <h2>The service</h2>
    <p>
      The bot is a free, independent, fan-made tool for Clash of Clans communities, run by an individual developer. It
      depends on Discord, Supercell's Clash of Clans API and other third-party services, so it can be slow, wrong or
      unavailable at times. It is provided "as is", without any promise of uptime, accuracy or fitness for a purpose.
    </p>

    <h2>Using the bot</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Follow the <a href="https://discord.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Discord Terms of Service</a> and Community Guidelines.</li>
      <li>Do not abuse, overload, reverse engineer or attempt to disrupt the bot or the services it relies on.</li>
      <li>Do not use the bot to harass others or to link accounts you do not own.</li>
      <li>Server admins are responsible for how the bot is configured in their server.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Supercell Store feature</h2>
    <p>
      The optional <code>/claim</code> feature uses your own Supercell Store session to collect rewards for you. It
      works by automating the store website, which is outside Supercell's official API. You use it at your own risk and
      are responsible for complying with Supercell's terms for your account. The developer is not responsible for any
      action Supercell takes on your account. See the <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> for how session data is handled.
    </p>

    <h2>No affiliation</h2>
    <p>
      Dragon Bot is not affiliated with, endorsed, or sponsored by Supercell. Clash of Clans and all related names, art
      and trademarks belong to Supercell.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes and ending access</h2>
    <p>
      Features may change or be removed at any time. Access to the bot may be limited or ended for servers or users who
      abuse it. You can stop using the bot at any time by removing it from your server and running <code>/unlink</code>.
    </p>

    <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>
      To the fullest extent permitted by law, the developer is not liable for any loss or damage arising from your use
      of the bot, including missed reminders, incorrect data, or actions taken by Supercell or Discord.
    </p>

    <h2>Updates to these terms</h2>
    <p>If these terms change, the date at the top will be updated. Continuing to use the bot means you accept the new terms.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      <a href={LINKS.discord} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Dragon Bot support server</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
